- Team ID
    GetGut@AAU

- Task ID
    6.2.1

- Run ID
    1

- Type of training applied
    Sentence-level relation classification using weighted funnel-based training with entity boundaries, as described in the scripts of this repository.

- Pre-processing methods
    Sentence-level entity pair extraction with character offset management. Marked text injection using [E1]/[/E1] and [E2]/[/E2] tags for subject and object entities. Text normalisation and lowercase conversion for predicate labels.

- Training data used
    Gold, silver, silver2025 and bronze

- Relevant details of the run
    - Base Model: BiomedNLP-BiomedBERT-large-uncased-abstract

- A link to a GitHub repository enabling easy reproducibility of the run:
   https://github.com/SophusJ/GetGut-AAU
